---
import { business } from '../config';
---

<section class="why-local">
  <div class="container why-local__content">
    <span class="eyebrow">Why local</span>
    <blockquote>Your tech guy is already in the neighborhood.</blockquote>
    <p style="margin-top: var(--space-3);">
      You shouldn't have to carry a desktop across Manhattan just to find out why
      it won't boot.
    </p>
    <p>
      I'm based on {business.baseLocation} and keep my primary service area
      intentionally small — roughly {business.serviceAreaShort}.
    </p>
    <p>
      That means less travel, faster appointments and a local technician you can
      call again when the next weird technology problem appears.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
